('教材','teaching material; textbook','giáo trình','noun','教材里的例子要放回上下文。','Put textbook examples back into context.','换教材也要确认难度。','Check difficulty when changing materials.'),
('基础','foundation; basics','nền tảng','noun','基础还不稳，先慢一点。','The foundations are not yet firm; slow down first.','基础练习也可以有具体目标。','Basic practice can have specific goals too.'),
('基本','basic; fundamental','cơ bản','adjective','先看基本要求。','Check the basic requirements first.','基本信息没确认就先问。','Ask if the basic information is unconfirmed.'),
