('听力','listening ability; listening practice','nghe hiểu','noun','听力练习先关掉文字。','Hide the text first for listening practice.','听力没听懂时再慢一点。','Slow down when the listening is not understood.'),
('试题','test question','câu hỏi thi','noun','这道试题的答案还要看原句。','This question’s answer requires checking the original sentence.','试题正确也要说明有没有帮助。','Even a correct answer should record whether help was used.'),
('题目','question; topic','đề bài','noun','先读题目，再选答案。','Read the question before selecting an answer.','题目问时间，不是问地点。','The question asks for time, not place.'),
('教练','coach; trainer','huấn luyện viên','noun','教练让她先放慢速度。','The coach asks her to slow down first.','教练的建议也要看具体情况。','A coach’s suggestion depends on the specific situation too.'),
('工夫','time; effort','thời gian; công sức','noun','她花了不少工夫核对发音。','She spent considerable time checking pronunciation.','有工夫就练一段，不必一次做完。','If there is time, practise a section; it need not be completed at once.'),
('功夫','skill; effort; martial arts','kỹ năng; công phu','noun','练这门功夫需要认真重复。','Learning this skill requires careful repetition.','有功夫也不能保证每次都对。','Skill does not guarantee correctness every time.'),
('功课','schoolwork; lessons','bài vở','noun','功课没做完，先标出剩下的。','Schoolwork is unfinished; mark what remains.','功课完成以后也要检查。','Check the schoolwork after completion too.'),
('力','strength; force','sức; lực','noun','说话别只用力，先说清楚。','Do not rely only on force; speak clearly first.','用力大小不等于意思准确。','The amount of force does not equal accuracy of meaning.'),
('实力','actual ability; strength','thực lực','noun','实力要看没有帮助时的表现。','Actual ability depends on performance without help.','一次成功不能说明全部实力。','One success does not establish overall ability.'),
('动力','motivation; driving force','động lực','noun','看懂一小段也给她动力。','Understanding a short section motivates her too.','动力变小就先换个具体目标。','When motivation declines, try another concrete goal.'),
