('输入','to enter; input','nhập','verb','输入答案前先看题目。','Read the question before entering the answer.','输入了不代表输入正确。','Entering something does not mean it was correct.'),
('了','to end; finish (liǎo)','xong; chấm dứt','verb','这件事没完没了，先定一个停止点。','This task is never-ending; set a stopping point.','讨论没完没了，不等于一直有进展。','Endless discussion does not imply continual progress.'),
