('工程师','engineer','kỹ sư','noun','工程师先看需求，再看机器。','The engineer checks requirements before the machine.','工程师也会问不清楚的地方。','Engineers also ask about unclear points.'),
('工厂','factory','nhà máy','noun','工厂参观先问能不能进入。','Ask whether entry is allowed before visiting the factory.','工厂的介绍不等于操作许可。','A factory introduction is not permission to operate equipment.'),
('工业','industry','công nghiệp','noun','工业发展不是这张图的全部内容。','Industrial development is not all the diagram describes.','工业词汇要说明具体领域。','Specify the domain of industrial vocabulary.'),
('生产','to produce; production','sản xuất','verb','这里生产的是教学模型。','They produce teaching models here.','生产多少要看实际记录。','Production quantity depends on actual records.'),
('制造','to manufacture','chế tạo','verb','制造机器和读说明不同。','Manufacturing a machine differs from reading instructions.','制造过程不能只凭猜测介绍。','Do not describe a manufacturing process solely by guessing.'),
