('机器','machine','máy móc','noun','机器还没打开，先读要求。','The machine is not yet switched on; read the requirements first.','机器能做什么，要看说明。','Check the instructions for what the machine can do.'),
('设备','equipment','thiết bị','noun','设备操作需要实际许可。','Operating the equipment needs actual authorization.','看过设备不等于会操作。','Seeing equipment does not mean knowing how to operate it.'),
('实验','experiment','thí nghiệm','noun','实验记录要写条件。','An experiment record should state conditions.','一次实验不能说明所有情况。','One experiment cannot establish every situation.'),
('实验室','laboratory','phòng thí nghiệm','noun','实验室开放时间还没确认。','The laboratory’s opening time is not yet confirmed.','进入实验室先看现场要求。','Check local requirements before entering the laboratory.'),
